WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:08.970
Record a transfer or cash payment against an invoice, or send the tenant a link to pay online.

2
00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.380
A tenant has paid. Find their invoice.

3
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:22.170
Record a payment is on the right. The amount is the balance still due.

4
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:28.650
Choose how they paid: transfer, cheque, card, cash, InstaPay, Fawry or a wallet.

5
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:34.160
Add the bank reference, so it can be matched later.

6
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.140
Choose Record payment.

7
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.760
The invoice is paid, the receipt is ready to print, and the accounts are updated by themselves.

8
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.940
Prefer the tenant pays online? Open an unpaid invoice.

9
00:00:52.320 --> 00:01:00.970
Under Online payment, create a link. The tenant pays by card, and the invoice is marked paid on its own.
